      and isZh time labels (Key Facts/Timeline etc.) are user-visible, but cross-module
      and some labels participate in LLM output parsing contracts.
      Each source file is annotated with // TODO i18n pending extraction.
    - transformer module (inside app): per file review, all Chinese strings are LLM
      prompt content (SYSTEM messages sent to LLM), logger messages, code comments, or
      internal exception messages. No directly user-visible UI strings; kept as-is per
      the "LLM prompts not extracted" rule.
